sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as app.py
    participant P as Analyzer
    participant M as Saved model files
    U->>A: Type review and press Check review
    A->>P: analyze(text, reviews_24h, age)
    P->>P: clean_text(text)
    P->>M: use vectorizer and best model
    M-->>P: fake probability
    P->>P: behavior_risk, trust_score, bot_status
    P->>P: explain_text and top_terms
    P-->>A: trust, level, verdict, reasons, terms
    A->>A: build gauge, badges, highlighted text
    A-->>U: Show result page
